        │@@     ┃        │@@
   1   1│alpha  ┃        │
   2   2│bravo  ┃        │
   3   3│charlie┃        │
-  4    │delta  ┃        │
+      4│DELTA  ┃        │
   5   5│echo   ┃        │
        │       ┃   5   5│ECHO
   6   6│foxtrot┃   6   6│foxtrot
   7   7│golf   ┃   7   7│golf
   8   8│hotel  ┃-  8    │hotel
        │       ┃+      8│HOTEL
   9   9│india  ┃   9   9│india
  10  10│juliet ┃  10  10│juliet
  11  11│kilo   ┃  11  11│kilo

═════════════════════════════════
*    CONTEXT DIFFERENCES        *
═════════════════════════════════
Signs mark lines present in only
one result: - patch1, + patch2.

